{"t":"Medusa Shield Quest","s":"medusa-shield-quest-2120c","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Drefia_Main_Dungeon_Entrance_f9a313.png","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Medusa Shield Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Star Room Quest, Necromancer Quest, Blue Robe Quest, Goshnar Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">60<br/>(70 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.3<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 11, 2004</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>The chief Necromancers of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Brotherhood%20of%20Bones\">Brotherhood of Bones</a> hold a valuable treasure here.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a> west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer\">Necromancers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Priest\">Blood Priests</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Hand\">Blood Hands</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">Mummies</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire\">Vampires</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Priestess\">Priestesses</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zombie\">Zombies</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rat\">Rats</a>, possibly <a href=\"#/wiki/Necropharus\">Necropharus</a> (rare spawn), and other <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Undead</a> creatures.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Medusa%20Shield\">Medusa Shield</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Skull%20Staff\">Skull Staff</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Robe\">Blue Robe</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\";\"><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Please review this page.</p><br/><p>This page may need to be updated for content, grammar, spelling, language, etc.</p><p style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:x-small;\">Please remove this template after the page has been raised to appropriate standards of quality.</p></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_equipment\">Required equipment</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li>\n<li>Prefered <a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison\">Antidote</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisible\">Invisible</a> spell.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Head to <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a> west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> and enter the main dungeon <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32996,32413,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32996, 32413, 7)</a>. It is advised to use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisible\">Invisibility</a> spell here due to the overwhelming undead force.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Follow the green lines to the third level of the main dungeon.\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"287\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drefia_Main_Dungeon_Entrance_f9a313.png\" width=\"676\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Follow the map above, or just descend to the third floor of the main dungeon.</li>\n<li>On the third floor, head straight north approximately 18 steps. To your left will be a hole. Open it with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a> and go down.</li></ul>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Follow the green lines through the level 60 gates\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"196\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drefia_Medusa_Shield_Quest_Path_384916.png\" width=\"300\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Follow the map above, or head east and through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">level</a> 60 <a href=\"#/wiki/Gate%20of%20Expertise\">Gate of Expertise</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Prepare yourself as there will be an army of undead up here (<a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghost\">Ghosts</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zombie\">Zombies</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire\">Vampires</a>, several <a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer\">Necromancers</a>, several <a href=\"#/wiki/Priestess\">Priestesses</a> and their summons (<a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghoul</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghost\">Ghosts</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">Mummies</a>)). <b>Note</b>: with luck, the room will already be clear. Beyond the quest room is <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia%20Wyrm%20Lair\">Drefia Wyrm Lair</a>, a popular hunting ground.</li>\n<li>A good strategy at lower levels would be to get either a mage or paladin to go invisible and <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">Great Fireball</a> the entire spawn a few times to clear out most of the monster spam so that you can take down the <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeleton</a>'s and Necromancers fast.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Medusa%20Shield\">Medusa Shield</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Robe\">Blue Robe</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Skull%20Staff\">Skull Staff</a> are located in a coffin in the easterly section of the room. There are also <a href=\"#/wiki/Daily%20Respawns\">Daily Respawns</a> on the sacrificial stones that you may take if no other players have done so (1 <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Pearl\">White Pearl</a>, 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Pearl\">Black Pearl</a>, 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a>, 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a>).</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["killing-in-the-name-of-quest","the-gravedigger-of-drefia-quest","the-lightbearer"]}